WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.979
The browser practice database is intentionally small
It includes sales

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:12.297
admissions survey responses and web events These are
not meant to be big-data examples

00:00:14.031 --> 00:00:17.702
They are meant to help you practice SQL logic before
running the same kind of

00:00:17.728 --> 00:00:18.754
logic in Spark
